- [Retrieving Vault Metadata Using Java](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazonglacier/latest/dev/retrieving-vault-info-sdk-java.md): Java code example of retrieving vault information and metadata in Amazon Glacier using the Amazon SDK for Java.
