- [Retrieving Vault Metadata Using REST](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazonglacier/latest/dev/listing-vaults-rest-api.md): Example of retrieving vault information in Amazon Glacier using the REST API.
- [Retrieving Vault Metadata Using the AWS CLI](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazonglacier/latest/dev/retrieving-vault-info-cli.md): Set up the AWS CLI and follow this example of retrieving vault information and metadata in Amazon Glacier.

