- [Downloading a Vault Inventory Using the AWS CLI](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazonglacier/latest/dev/retrieving-vault-inventory-cli.md): Example of downloading or retrieving a vault inventory in Amazon Glacier using the AWS CLI.

