- [Deleting an Archive Using .NET](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazonglacier/latest/dev/deleting-an-archive-using-dot-net.md): C# code examples of how to delete an archive from a vault in Amazon Glacier using the Amazon SDK for .NET for both high-level and low-level APIs.
